<section class="story" style="margin-top:48px">
  <div class="story-img"><div class="frame"><img src="https://peachandflow.com/cdn/shop/files/IMG_5310_2.heic?v=1778418866&width=1100" alt="Peach &amp; Flow founder outside a London townhouse" /></div></div>
  <div class="story-copy">
    <span class="eyebrow">How it started</span>
    <h2>The Peach &amp; Flow Story</h2>
    <p>We started Peach &amp; Flow for the studio regulars, the ones who show up, put in the work, and refuse to compromise on any part of their practice.</p>
    <p>We believe looking good isn't superficial, it's empowering. We believe quality should be accessible, not exclusive. We believe your socks should work as hard as you do while making you feel like the best version of yourself.</p>
    <p>This is for everyone who's tired of settling. For the community that values both substance and style.</p>
    <p>Welcome to Peach &amp; Flow. Built for people who expect more.</p>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center">
    <span class="eyebrow">A note from our founder</span>
    <p style="font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2.6vw,1.8rem);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.35;margin:18px 0 14px">“We made the socks we could not find: grippy enough for the studio, cute enough for everywhere else.”</p>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);font-weight:700">Charlie · Founder, Peach &amp; Flow</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">What we stand for</span><h2 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-top:10px">The little things, done properly.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="cardrow" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px">
<div style="background:var(--cream-soft);border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:32px"><h3 style="font-size:1.28rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:10px">Genuinely grippy</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55">Full-coverage hex grip that keeps you planted through every plank, lunge and down-dog, wash after wash.</p></div>
<div style="background:var(--cream-soft);border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:32px"><h3 style="font-size:1.28rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:10px">Properly comfy</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55">An 85% cotton cushion sole and an arch-supported, anti-roll cuff that feels good from first class to last.</p></div>
<div style="background:var(--cream-soft);border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:32px"><h3 style="font-size:1.28rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:10px">Impossibly cute</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55">Designs you&rsquo;ll actually want to wear off the mat too, from matcha to watermelons to smiley faces.</p></div>
</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;text-align:center">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-bottom:24px">Find your pair.</h2>
    <a class="btn" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Shop the collection</a>
  </div>
</section>
